<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The Lord God Almighty created!</l><l>The Lord God Almighty created!</l><l>He powerfully made all we see.</l><l>The Lord God Almighty created!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The Lord God Almighty is precise!</l><l>The Lord God Almighty is precise!</l><l>The planets pass without a crash —</l><l>The Lord God Almighty is precise!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The Lord God Almighty is patient!</l><l>The Lord God Almighty is patient!</l><l>Normal and slow is the way things grow —</l><l>The Lord God Almighty is patient!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
